  "prefLabel": "Env-A 3010.02 Misdemeanors and Felonies",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-A 3010.02 Misdemeanors and Felonies. Any person who knowingly or willfully commits a violation of Env-A 3009.01(a), Env-A 3009.01(b), or Env-A 3009.01(c) shall be guilty of a misdemeanor if a natural person, or guilty of a felony if any other person.\n\nSource. #6441, EXEMPT, eff 1-21-97",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/env-a3000.html"
